<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:20:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</link><description>尽管人们对人工智能繁荣和相关工业金属需求的持久性仍存疑虑，但铜价从 11 个月低点上涨逾 3%，追随科技股的涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals'&gt;由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Rebounds From Lowest This Year as Volatility Grips Metals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:01:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印度航空首席执行官寻求今年削减 6.5 亿美元成本</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</link><description>据知情人士透露，印度航空有限公司希望本财年削减 600 亿卢比（6.5 亿美元）的成本，其新任首席执行官概述了振兴塔塔集团旗下航空公司的举措，该航空公司在截至 3 月份的财年中出现了创纪录的亏损。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year'&gt;印度航空首席执行官寻求今年削减 6.5 亿美元成本&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Air India’s New CEO Announces Efficiency Measures to Pare Costs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:20:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国的铜紧缩掩盖了脆弱的需求前景</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/china-s-copper-crunch-hides-a-fragile-demand-outlook</link><description>短期供应紧张比经济增长疲弱更容易解决。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/china-s-copper-crunch-hides-a-fragile-demand-outlook'&gt;中国的铜紧缩掩盖了脆弱的需求前景&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China’s Copper Crunch Hides a Fragile Demand Outlook&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/china-s-copper-crunch-hides-a-fragile-demand-outlook</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:15:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>警惕通胀的购物者为黑色星期五做好准备（视频）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/inflation-wary-shoppers-prepare-for-black-friday-video</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/inflation-wary-shoppers-prepare-for-black-friday-video'&gt;警惕通胀的购物者为黑色星期五做好准备（视频）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Inflation-Wary Shoppers Prepare for Black Friday (Video)&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/inflation-wary-shoppers-prepare-for-black-friday-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:18:13 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>